IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `or336-nouns`
IMPORT `or336-art336a`

-- Tests for Art. 336a OR (layer 1, or336-art336a.l4).
--
-- Expected values were written from the German text before the file was run.
-- The wage is the monthly wage of the employee; the cap is that wage times
-- six ("dem Lohn des Arbeitnehmers für sechs Monate", Art. 336a(2)) or times
-- two ("den Lohn des Arbeitnehmers für zwei Monate", Art. 336a(3)).
-- Amounts are in whatever currency the wage is stated in (the text names none).

§ `Tests for Art 336a`

§§ `Art 336a(1): who owes the compensation`

-- "Die Partei, die das Arbeitsverhältnis missbräuchlich kündigt, hat der anderen Partei eine Entschädigung auszurichten."
#ASSERT `Art 336a(1) the party giving notice owes the other party compensation` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the text speaks only of an abusive notice: silent for a notice that is not abusive on a listed ground, and where abusiveness is not decided.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(1) the party giving notice owes the other party compensation` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 336a(1) the party giving notice owes the other party compensation` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Art 336a(2): the amount is for the judge`

-- "Die Entschädigung wird vom Richter unter Würdigung aller Umstände festgesetzt": the encoding gives no amount.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the amount of the compensation` EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Art 336a(2): the cap of six months' wages`

-- 6 x 5000 = 30000.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the cap of six months' wages` (JUST TRUE) 5000 EQUALS JUST 30000
-- 6 x 4500.50 = 27003.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the cap of six months' wages` (JUST TRUE) 4500.5 EQUALS JUST 27003
-- a wage of nothing gives a cap of nothing (6 x 0 = 0), which is a cap and not "no cap".
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the cap of six months' wages` (JUST TRUE) 0 EQUALS JUST 0
-- a negative amount is no wage: "Lohn" is not defined in the encoded text.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the cap of six months' wages` (JUST TRUE) (0 MINUS 1) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the cap belongs to the compensation of an abusive notice only.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the cap of six months' wages` (JUST FALSE) 5000 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the cap of six months' wages` NOTHING 5000 EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Art 336a(2): damages on another legal basis are reserved`

-- the compensation of Art. 336a is the thing the cap limits.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the cap limits this claim` `compensation under Art 336a` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "Schadenersatzansprüche aus einem anderen Rechtstitel sind vorbehalten": the cap does not limit them.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the cap limits this claim` `damages on another legal basis` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the text speaks of nothing else.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the cap limits this claim` `another kind of claim` EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Art 336a(3): the cap of two months' wages, mass dismissal without consultation`

-- "so darf die Entschädigung nicht mehr als den Lohn des Arbeitnehmers für zwei Monate betragen": 2 x 5000 = 10000.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(3) the cap of two months' wages` (JUST TRUE) 5000 EQUALS JUST 10000
#ASSERT `Art 336a(3) the cap of two months' wages` (JUST TRUE) 4500.5 EQUALS JUST 9001
-- a wage of nothing gives a cap of nothing (2 x 0 = 0), which is a cap and not "no cap".
#ASSERT `Art 336a(3) the cap of two months' wages` (JUST TRUE) 0 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `Art 336a(3) the cap of two months' wages` (JUST TRUE) (0 MINUS 1) EQUALS NOTHING
-- "Ist die Kündigung nach Artikel 336 Absatz 2 Buchstabe c missbräuchlich": not met, or not decided: the paragraph is silent.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(3) the cap of two months' wages` (JUST FALSE) 5000 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 336a(3) the cap of two months' wages` NOTHING 5000 EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Art 336a(2) and (3) together: the most the compensation can be`

-- abusive, not under Art. 336(2)(c): only paragraph 2 binds: 6 x 5000 = 30000.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) and (3) the most the compensation can be` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) 5000 EQUALS JUST 30000
-- abusive under Art. 336(2)(c): both paragraphs say "darf ... nicht", the lower binds: 2 x 5000 = 10000.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) and (3) the most the compensation can be` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) 5000 EQUALS JUST 10000
-- an employee's notice: Art. 336(2)(c) is NOTHING (it speaks of the employer's notice): only paragraph 2 binds.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) and (3) the most the compensation can be` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING 5000 EQUALS JUST 30000
-- a wage with a fraction: 6 x 4500.50 = 27003, and 2 x 4500.50 = 9001.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) and (3) the most the compensation can be` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) 4500.5 EQUALS JUST 27003
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) and (3) the most the compensation can be` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) 4500.5 EQUALS JUST 9001
-- not abusive on a listed ground: the text sets no cap.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) and (3) the most the compensation can be` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) 5000 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) and (3) the most the compensation can be` NOTHING NOTHING 5000 EQUALS NOTHING
-- a negative amount is no wage.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) and (3) the most the compensation can be` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) (0 MINUS 1) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Art 336a(2): an amount stays within the cap`

-- "darf aber den Betrag nicht übersteigen": one below the cap, on the cap, one above it (cap 30000).
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the compensation stays within the cap` 29999 (JUST 30000) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the compensation stays within the cap` 30000 (JUST 30000) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the compensation stays within the cap` 30001 (JUST 30000) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the same around the two-month cap (10000).
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the compensation stays within the cap` 9999 (JUST 10000) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the compensation stays within the cap` 10000 (JUST 10000) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the compensation stays within the cap` 10001 (JUST 10000) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- an amount of nothing is within any cap.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the compensation stays within the cap` 0 (JUST 10000) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no cap is determined: nothing to measure the amount against.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the compensation stays within the cap` 5000 NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Art 336a(1) and (2) joined: from the abusive notice to the figure`

-- an abusive notice, wage 5000, a judge's amount of 20000: the duty exists, the cap is 30000, the amount is within it.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(1) the party giving notice owes the other party compensation` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the compensation stays within the cap` 20000 (`Art 336a(2) and (3) the most the compensation can be` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) 5000) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the same wage, a mass dismissal without consultation, an amount of 20000: the cap is 10000, the amount exceeds it.
#ASSERT `Art 336a(2) the compensation stays within the cap` 20000 (`Art 336a(2) and (3) the most the compensation can be` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) 5000) EQUALS JUST FALSE
